go-midi-player
==============

A MIDI player written in Go.

Work in progress: it parses Standard MIDI Files and prints a summary,
but does not play audio yet.

* reads the header (format, track count, time division)
* parses the events of every track, including running status
* counts the notes in each track

Usage
-----

Run it from the src directory:

	cd src
	go run . <file.mid>

Example output:

	format 1, 8 tracks, division 120
	track 0: 66 events, 0 notes
	track 1: 1966 events, 722 notes
	track 2: 851 events, 423 notes
